    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of boundaries,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ὅριος</span>”
